  <description>
    <p>
      DevSticky keeps your code snippets, commands and to-dos one click away in the top bar.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Markdown notes with syntax-highlighted code blocks and a copy button</li>
      <li>Tags and instant full-text search</li>
      <li>Quick search panel from the top-bar icon</li>
      <li>Note colors, pinning and autosave</li>
      <li>Fully offline, with export and import to move notes between machines</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
